---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Architectural Scale Model Maker | Custom Models | Carve Model"
  description="Custom architectural scale models for architects and developers—built for design reviews, planning approvals, investor presentations, and real estate sales galleries."
  canonicalPath="/architectural-scale-models"
  ogTitle="Architectural Scale Model Maker | Custom Models | Carve Model"
  ogDescription="Custom architectural scale models for architects and developers—built for approvals, presentations, and real estate sales galleries."
  active="services"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/architectural-scale-models#service","url":"https://www.physical-model.com/architectural-scale-models","name":"Architectural & Real Estate Models","serviceType":"Architectural & Real Estate Models","provider":{"@type":"ProfessionalService","@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/#organization","name":"Carve Model","url":"https://www.physical-model.com/"},"areaServed":[{"@type":"Country","name":"United States"},{"@type":"Country","name":"Canada"}]}`} />
<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/architectural-scale-models#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.physical-model.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Services","item":"https://www.physical-model.com/scale-model-services"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Architectural & Real Estate Models","item":"https://www.physical-model.com/architectural-scale-models"}]}`} />
<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/architectural-scale-models#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What information do you need to provide a preliminary estimate?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We can begin with architectural drawings, CAD, BIM, Revit, Rhino or SketchUp files, renderings, photographs, or other available project information. Please also include the intended use, preferred scale or approximate model dimensions, required completion date, and delivery location. Complete production-ready files are not required for the initial review."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do you determine the appropriate scale for an architectural model?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The appropriate scale depends on the size of the project, the information the model must communicate, viewing distance, required level of detail, available display space, and transportation requirements. Smaller scales generally work well for masterplans and overall massing, while larger scales allow more architectural, material, landscape, and interior detail. We calculate the resulting model dimensions and recommend a suitable scale during project review. Read our <a href=\\"https://www.physical-model.com/blog/how-to-choose-architectural-model-scale\\">guide to choosing an architectural model scale</a>."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does an architectural model take to produce?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Carve Model typically targets approximately 14-21 days of internal production for a standard architectural model. Client reviews, revisions, shipping, installation, and unusually large or detailed scopes require additional time. We provide a project-specific schedule after reviewing the files and requirements."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does an architectural scale model cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Carve Model projects generally start at US$4,000. Final pricing depends on the model's dimensions, scale, level of detail, source files, materials, finishes, lighting, display case, schedule, packaging, delivery, and installation requirements. We provide a preliminary estimate after reviewing the intended use and available project information. Read our <a href=\\"https://www.physical-model.com/blog/architectural-scale-model-cost-us\\">architectural model pricing guide</a>."}}]}`} />
<style>
.breadcrumb{padding-top:1.6rem;}
.breadcrumb a{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--cm-text-subtle);transition:color var(--dur-2);}
.breadcrumb a:hover{color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
.page-hero{padding-top:1.6rem;padding-bottom:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem);border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);}
.page-hero h1{margin-top:1.4rem;}
.page-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
.page-hero p{margin-top:1.4rem;}
.page-hero__inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,3rem);align-items:center;}
@media(max-width:900px){.page-hero__inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.page-hero__visual{order:-1;max-width:440px;}}
.sa-photo{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:var(--ar);background:var(--cm-ink-850);border:1px solid var(--cm-border);overflow:hidden;}
.sa-photo img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;}
.page-hero__visual{position:relative;}
.page-hero__visual image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;}
.page-hero__visual .corner{position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;border:1px solid var(--cm-silver);opacity:0.5;z-index:3;}
.page-hero__visual .corner.tl{top:-1px;left:-1px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0;}
.page-hero__visual .corner.br{bottom:-1px;right:-1px;border-left:0;border-top:0;}
.hero__spec{position:absolute;right:-12px;bottom:24px;z-index:4;background:var(--cm-ink-800);border:1px solid var(--cm-border-strong);padding:0.9rem 1.1rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);}
.hero__spec .tick{display:block;}
.hero__spec strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--w-bold);color:var(--cm-text-strong);font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
.hero__cta{display:flex;gap:0.9rem;flex-wrap:nowrap;margin-top:1.8rem;}
@media(max-width:560px){.hero__cta{flex-wrap:wrap;}}
.hero__cta .btn--primary,.hero__cta .btn--ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--cm-text-strong);border:1px solid var(--cm-border-strong);}
.hero__cta .btn--primary:hover,.hero__cta .btn--ghost:hover{background:var(--cm-accent);color:var(--cm-accent-contrast);border-color:var(--cm-accent);}
.svc-all-btn{background:transparent;color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
.svc-all-btn:hover{background:var(--cm-accent);color:var(--cm-accent-contrast);border-color:var(--cm-accent);}
.dedi-media{margin-top:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);}
.dedi-media image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:21/9;}
.dedi-body{padding-block:clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem);}
.dedi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem);align-items:start;}
.dedi-grid h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,2.8vw,2.4rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;}
.dedi-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:1.4rem 0 0;display:grid;gap:0.8rem;}
.dedi-list li{display:flex;gap:0.7rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:1rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
.dedi-list li svg{flex:none;margin-top:4px;color:var(--cm-silver);}
@media(max-width:820px){.dedi-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.svc-section{padding-block:clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem);border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);}
.svc-section h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,2.8vw,2.4rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-top:1rem;}
.svc-section .lead-p{margin-top:1.2rem;max-width:68ch;}
.svc-checklist{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:1.8rem 0 0;display:grid;gap:0.75rem;max-width:68ch;}
.svc-checklist li{display:flex;gap:0.7rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:1rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
.svc-checklist li svg{flex:none;margin-top:4px;color:var(--cm-silver);}
.svc-types{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.6rem);margin-top:2rem;}
.svc-type{padding-top:0;border-top:0;}
.svc-type__media{margin-bottom:0.9rem;}
.svc-type__media image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;}
.svc-type h3{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:var(--w-semibold);color:var(--cm-text-strong);letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
.svc-type__link{display:block;color:inherit;}
.svc-type__cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;margin-top:1rem;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.03em;color:var(--cm-text-strong);border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-border-strong);padding-bottom:2px;transition:border-color var(--dur-2);}
.svc-type__cta:hover{border-color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
.svc-type p{margin-top:0.5rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;max-width:none;}
@media(max-width:760px){.svc-types{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.svc-steps{display:grid;gap:0;margin-top:2rem;max-width:68ch;}
.svc-step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.4rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding-block:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);}
.svc-step:last-child{border-bottom:0;}
.svc-step__n{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--cm-text-subtle);padding-top:0.15rem;}
.svc-step p{color:var(--cm-text-muted);font-size:1rem;}
.svc-note{margin-top:1.4rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);max-width:68ch;}
.formats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--cm-line-faint);border:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);margin-top:1.8rem;}
.fmt{position:relative;background:var(--cm-ink-900);padding:1.4rem 1rem;text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--cm-gray-300);letter-spacing:0.03em;transition:background var(--dur-3),color var(--dur-3);}
.fmt:hover{background:var(--cm-ink-850);color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
@media(max-width:760px){.formats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
@media(max-width:480px){.formats{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.svc-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem);align-items:start;}
.svc-split .svc-checklist,.svc-split .lead-p{max-width:none;}
.svc-split__media image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/5;}
@media(max-width:900px){.svc-split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.svc-split__media{order:-1;max-width:440px;}}
.svc-faq{max-width:68ch;}
.svc-faq .faq-list{border-top:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);margin-top:1.8rem;}
.svc-faq .faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);}
.svc-faq .faq-item p a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-decoration-color:var(--cm-border-strong);transition:text-decoration-color var(--dur-2);}
.svc-faq .faq-item p a:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor;}
.svc-faq .faq-item summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:1.3rem 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;align-items:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--w-semibold);font-size:1rem;color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
.svc-faq .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
.svc-faq .faq-item .pm{position:relative;width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;}
.svc-faq .faq-item .pm::before,.svc-faq .faq-item .pm::after{content:"";position:absolute;background:var(--cm-silver);transition:transform var(--dur-3);}
.svc-faq .faq-item .pm::before{top:7.5px;left:0;width:16px;height:1.5px;}
.svc-faq .faq-item .pm::after{top:0;left:7.5px;width:1.5px;height:16px;}
.svc-faq .faq-item[open] .pm::after{transform:scaleY(0);}
.svc-faq .faq-item p{margin-top:0;padding:0 0 1.3rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
</style>
</Fragment>

<main>
<div class="container breadcrumb"><a href="/scale-model-services">← All services</a></div>

<section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
  <div class="page-hero__inner">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Services / Architecture &amp; Real Estate</span>
      <h1 class="display-lg measure">Custom architectural<br><em>scale models</em><br>built for confident<br><em>decisions</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lead measure">Carve Model is a professional architectural scale model maker serving architects, real estate developers, contractors, and institutions across the United States and Canada. We create custom architectural models for design reviews, planning approvals, investor presentations, exhibitions, and sales galleries.</p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact">Get a Preliminary Estimate <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/works">View Architectural Work <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <p class="muted measure" style="margin-top:1.6rem;">Work directly with a dedicated Carve client manager who understands your model, schedule, and priorities—from initial review and approvals through fabrication, delivery, and installation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="page-hero__visual reveal">
      <span class="corner tl"></span><span class="corner br"></span>
      <picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-hero-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-hero-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-hero-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:900px) min(100vw,440px), 650px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-hero-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-hero-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-hero-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:900px) min(100vw,440px), 650px"><img src="/assets/sa-hero-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Illuminated architectural model of a residential villa with glazed living levels and a roof terrace" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></picture>
      <span class="slot-label">Residential Villa · 1:50 · ABS</span>
      <div class="hero__spec">
        <span class="tick">PROJECTS DELIVERED</span>
        <strong>500+ models</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">What architectural models support</span>
  <h2>Bring the complete project into view.</h2>
  <div class="svc-split" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">
    <div>
      <p class="lead-p muted" style="margin-top:0;">Drawings, renderings, BIM, animation, and virtual environments communicate different aspects of a design. A physical model brings the project's scale, form, context, and spatial relationships into one tangible object that people can examine together.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">Depending on the project, an architectural model can help teams:</p>
      <ul class="svc-checklist">
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Evaluate massing, height, density, and proportion</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Understand site, landscape, and urban relationships</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Review circulation, access, and public space</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Communicate with technical and nontechnical audiences</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Support planning and government approvals</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Present projects to investors and stakeholders</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Create a focal point for a sales gallery or exhibition</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Document a completed or existing development</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-split__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/5;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-support-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-support-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-support-956.avif 956w" sizes="(max-width:900px) min(100vw,440px), 510px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-support-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-support-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-support-956.webp 956w" sizes="(max-width:900px) min(100vw,440px), 510px"><img src="/assets/sa-support-800.webp" width="956" height="1195" alt="Architectural model of white high-rise towers suspended above a glass-enclosed structure beneath a steel-framed atrium roof" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Model purposes</span>
  <h2>Architectural models for your presentation goals.</h2>
  <div class="svc-types">
    <div class="svc-type"><a class="svc-type__link" href="/real-estate-sales-gallery-models" aria-label="Real Estate Sales Gallery &amp; Exhibition Models"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sg-hero-480.avif 480w, /assets/sg-hero-800.avif 800w, /assets/sg-hero-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sg-hero-480.webp 480w, /assets/sg-hero-800.webp 800w, /assets/sg-hero-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sg-hero-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Illuminated model of two glass towers on a landscaped podium, displayed in a real estate sales lobby" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div></a><h3>Real Estate Sales Gallery &amp; Exhibition Models</h3><p>Detailed architectural models for property sales and dedicated exhibition spaces. Present buildings, landscaping and amenities with refined finishes, lighting and optional digital experiences.</p><a class="svc-type__cta" href="/real-estate-sales-gallery-models">Explore <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="svc-type"><a class="svc-type__link" href="/trade-show-convention-models" aria-label="Trade Show &amp; Convention Models"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-trade-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-trade-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-trade-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-trade-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-trade-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-trade-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-trade-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Architectural model of a multi-level mobility hub with rooftop aircraft landing pads and a street-level drop-off area" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div></a><h3>Trade Show &amp; Convention Models</h3><p>Portable architectural models for presentations across multiple venues. Size, weight, protective packaging and setup requirements are planned around booth space, transportation and repeated use.</p><a class="svc-type__cta" href="/trade-show-convention-models">Explore <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="svc-type"><a class="svc-type__link" href="/stakeholder-investor-fundraising-models" aria-label="Stakeholder, Investor &amp; Fundraising Models"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-investor-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-investor-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-investor-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-investor-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-investor-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-investor-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-investor-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Architectural model of a low-rise campus with courtyards, shown in an acrylic display case on a draped table" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div></a><h3>Stakeholder, Investor &amp; Fundraising Models</h3><p>Models for stakeholder meetings, investor presentations and fundraising campaigns. Explain the project vision, development phases and key features through a clear physical presentation.</p><a class="svc-type__cta" href="/stakeholder-investor-fundraising-models">Explore <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
    <div class="svc-type"><a class="svc-type__link" href="/design-competition-models" aria-label="Design Competition Models"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-competition-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-competition-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-competition-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-competition-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-competition-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-competition-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-competition-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Illuminated architectural model of a low-rise building with glowing translucent facades, a green roof and a landscaped entrance drive" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div></a><h3>Design Competition Models</h3><p>Models that communicate design intent for competition submissions. We work with your team to define the scale, materials and essential details around the submission requirements and deadline.</p><a class="svc-type__cta" href="/design-competition-models">Explore <span class="arrow">→</span></a></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <div class="flex justify-between items-center wrap gap">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Model types</span>
      <h2>Choose the model type that fits your project.</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn--ghost svc-all-btn" href="/works">View Our Work <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="svc-types">
    <div class="svc-type"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-concept-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-concept-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-concept-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-concept-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-concept-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-concept-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-concept-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="White concept massing model of a building complex arranged around a courtyard on a flat base" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div><h3>Concept &amp; Massing Models</h3><p>Simplified models exploring building volumes, height, proportion and spatial relationships. Emphasize the overall design concept, circulation and relationship to the site.</p></div>
    <div class="svc-type"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-detailed-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-detailed-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-detailed-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-detailed-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-detailed-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-detailed-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-detailed-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Illuminated detailed architectural model of a stepped modern building with glazing, furnished interiors and a rooftop pool" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div><h3>Detailed Architectural Models</h3><p>Models with developed façades, glazing, materials and architectural details. Represent proposed designs or existing buildings, with scale and finish selected to communicate the features that matter.</p></div>
    <div class="svc-type"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-masterplan-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-masterplan-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-masterplan-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-masterplan-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-masterplan-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-masterplan-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-masterplan-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Masterplan model of a residential district with white building masses, landscaping and a road network" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div><h3>Masterplan &amp; Urban Models</h3><p>Models showing multiple buildings, streets, infrastructure and public spaces within a wider development or urban context. Explain density, connectivity and relationships between different areas.</p></div>
    <div class="svc-type"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-topo-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-topo-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-topo-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-topo-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-topo-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-topo-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-topo-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Topographic model of a mountain landscape showing terrain, roads and hillside settlements" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div><h3>Landscape, Site &amp; Topographic Models</h3><p>Models showing terrain, planting, paths, roads, water features and outdoor spaces. Communicate landscape design, changes in elevation and the relationship between buildings and their surroundings.</p></div>
    <div class="svc-type"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-interior-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-interior-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-interior-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-interior-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-interior-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-interior-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-interior-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Overhead view of an office interior model with desks, chairs, meeting rooms and planters behind a glazed perimeter" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div><h3>Interior Models</h3><p>Models presenting rooms, floor layouts, furniture, finishes and lighting. Show how interior spaces connect and how materials, proportions and design details work together.</p></div>
    <div class="svc-type"><div class="svc-type__media"><picture class="sa-photo" style="--ar:4/3;"><source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/sa-cutaway-480.avif 480w, /assets/sa-cutaway-800.avif 800w, /assets/sa-cutaway-1200.avif 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/sa-cutaway-480.webp 480w, /assets/sa-cutaway-800.webp 800w, /assets/sa-cutaway-1200.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:760px) 92vw, 570px"><img src="/assets/sa-cutaway-800.webp" width="1200" height="900" alt="Cutaway model of an auditorium showing the stage and tiered red seating" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture></div><h3>Cutaway &amp; Section Models</h3><p>Models with selected portions removed or opened to reveal internal spaces. Explain relationships between floors, circulation, structure and exterior form that would otherwise remain hidden.</p></div>
